quiet 3000 20000
send First write two short sentences on two lines saying that you are about to ask me something. Then use the AskUserQuestion tool once, with one question, header Colour: which colour do you prefer, options red, green, blue. After I answer, reply with my answer in one short sentence.
sleep 200
send \r
wait 90000 \x07
quiet 3000 20000
send 2
sleep 100
send \r
quiet 3000 10000
send y
sleep 100
send \r
wait 60000 \x07
quiet 4000 30000
send /exit
sleep 200
send \r
exit 10000
